# Cline Rules: Marlin Bed Leveling

Autonomous 3D Printer Bed Leveling & Calibration Specialist.

- `G28` (Home All) automatically disables bed leveling in Marlin; place `M420 S1 Z10.0` immediately after `G28`.
- Downward-deploying probes must have negative Z-offsets (`M851 Z-...`).
- Mandate a 5-minute pre-heat soak before running `G29` mesh probing.
- Save mesh to slot 1 with `G29 S1` and commit to EEPROM with `M500`.
- Verify probe repeatability with `M48 P10` ($s \le 0.005\text{mm}$).
